## Build Status

| Crate | Status | Build Notes |
|-------|--------|-------------|
| `hace-brain-base` | ✅ COMPILABLE | `no_std` compliant, has AlgoParticle impl |
| `hace-brain-runtime` | ✅ COMPILABLE | ZeusRouter, ZeusRuntime with stub bridges |
| `hace-brain-master` | ✅ COMPILABLE | Master runtime stub, no real dispatch |
| `hace-brain-hooks` | ✅ COMPILABLE | Empty shell |

## Joints Analysis

### brain/base (Reasoning Kernel Interface)
- ✅ `BrainKernel` trait - universal reasoning interface
- ✅ `BrainRuntime` trait - CE contract
- ✅ `AlgoParticle` - deterministic CE implementation  
- ✅ `ReasonCtx`/`ReasonResult`/`BrainError` - core types
- ✅ `BrainProfile` - expert configuration
- ✅ `classify_complexity()` - routing logic
- ✅ Tests: 7 passing (algo rule match, complexity routing)

### brain/runtime (Zeus CE Coordinator)  
- ⚠️ `ZeusRouter` - chọn CE dựa complexity, fallback xuống Algo
- ❌ `HacedleBridge` - **stub no-op** (không gọi HacedleBrain)
- ❌ `HacetralBridge` - **stub no-op** (không gọi HacetralEngine)
- ✅ `RouteResult` - wrapper for CE output
- ✅ `ZeusRuntime` - router + optional profile

### brain/master (Orchestrator)
- ❌ `BrainMasterRuntime.execute()` - trả `SioOutcome::default()` luôn
- ❌ `RuntimeDispatcher.dispatch()` - **stub** không dispatch provider
- ❌ `execute_brain()` - trả chuỗi "TODO"
- ⚠️ `ProviderRegistry` - BTreeMap nhưng không có provider thật registered
- ⚠️ `BrainProvider` trait - declare mà chưa có impl

### brain/src/op (Operators)
- ✅ `rmsnorm.rs` - RMSNorm f32 implementation
- ✅ `rope.rs` - RoPE pairwise implementation (Qwen2.5 theta=1000000)
- ✅ `matmul.rs` - naive GEMM (O(n³))
- ✅ `silu.rs` - SiLU/Swish activation

### brain/src/block
- ⚠️ `brain_block.rs` - BrainBlock struct chỉ khai báo weight, `forward()` trả placeholder
- ⚠️ `attention.rs` - QKV projection stub, softmax, GQA logic
- ❌ Missing: KV cache, FFN integration

### brain/src/registry
- ⚠️ `operator_registry.rs` - HashMap stub, chưa đăng ký operator nào

