## GAPs (Critical Breach Points)

| Location | Breach Point | Severity | Impact |
|----------|--------------|----------|--------|
| `runtime/bridges/hacedle.rs` | invoke() returns stub output | HIGH | Không inference được |
| `runtime/bridges/hacetral.rs` | invoke() returns stub output | HIGH | Không compile DSL được |
| `master/dispatcher.rs` | dispatch() stub, no provider call | HIGH | Master không hoạt động |
| `master/execute/mod.rs` | execute_brain() returns "TODO" | HIGH | Execution broken |
| `src/block/brain_block.rs` | forward() returns placeholder | MEDIUM | Model forward broken |
| `fem/hacedle/src/lib.rs` | No BrainKernel implementation | HIGH | CE dispatch gap |
| `fem/hacetral/src/runtime.rs` | No BrainKernel impl | MEDIUM | CE dispatch gap |
| `src/registry/operator_registry.rs` | Operators HashMap empty | MEDIUM | No operator registration |

